title: Instructions/delete_tiddler

Deletes a tiddler from the store and removes its `.tid` file from disk.

|!Parameter |!Required |!Description |
|`title` |yes |The tiddler title to delete |

<$wl.callout kind="warning">

''Warning:'' This operation cannot be undone (unless you have a backup or version control). The server's instructions tell the AI never to delete without an explicit user request.

</$wl.callout>

''Example prompts:''

* "Delete the tiddler called old-draft"
